0..78 Comment "// `gc` collects an empty restriction and `scope` extrudes one past a parallel"
79..153 Comment "// component. They overlap at `par(nu(nil), q)`, which completion joins by"
154..230 Comment "// the rule `nu(par(nil, q)) ==> par(nil, q)`; that rule and `scope` overlap"
231..311 Comment "// in turn, joined by the same rule with `nil` wrapped in `par(□, q\')`, and so"
312..386 Comment "// on, one wrapping deeper every round, where no rule rewrites a wrapping."
387..464 Comment "// Completion never ends, and the block is refused by name at the second rule"
465..533 Comment "// it derives rather than once its budget of derived rules runs out."
534..536 Comment "//"
537..552 Comment "// - see: #1604"
553..586 Comment "// - see: #1917 — `Restriction`"
588..658 Comment "/// A restriction that extrudes its scope and is collected once empty."
